{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/mercedes-benz-places-binghatti-meydan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1359,"crm_id":"595","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Mercedes-Benz Places Binghatti City","slug":"mercedes-benz-places-binghatti-meydan","display_address":"Meydan","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Binghatti","price":1360000,"display_price":"1.36M","lattitude":6153739.235289694,"longitude":2898915.503996831,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Mercedes-Benz Places – Binghatti City at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/meydan/\">Meydan</a> is the world’s first Mercedes-Benz branded city, redefining branded living through an ambitious urban vision. With a total investment value of Dh30 billion, this landmark destination is developed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-binghatti/\">Binghatti </a>as its first fully master-planned community, setting a new benchmark for integrated luxury development in Dubai.</p><p>Designed as a multi-tower branded city, the project features Mercedes-Benz-branded residential towers located in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/nad-al-sheba/\">Nad Al Sheba</a>, offering <strong>studio and 3-bedroom apartments</strong> with high ROI potential. Planned elements include cultural and leisure districts, retail boulevards, parks and green corridors, mobility hubs, and wellness and sports zones.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mercedes_Benz_Binghatti_City_Feature_4e01e45946.jpg","hash":"Mercedes_Benz_Binghatti_City_Feature_4e01e45946","name":"Mercedes Benz - Binghatti City Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_e51e315735.jpg","hash":"Banner_e51e315735","name":"Mercedes Benz - Binghatti City Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_6_101747db68.jpg","hash":"Gallery_6_101747db68","name":"Gallery-6.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_2_1a632676ef.jpg","hash":"Gallery_2_1a632676ef","name":"Gallery-2.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_3_575b6dd3da.jpg","hash":"Gallery_3_575b6dd3da","name":"Gallery-3.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_1_44e9f82a6e.jpg","hash":"Gallery_1_44e9f82a6e","name":"Gallery-1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_4_49727af86a.jpg","hash":"Gallery_4_49727af86a","name":"Gallery-4.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_5_139cb89e2d.jpg","hash":"Gallery_5_139cb89e2d","name":"Gallery-5.jpg"}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":1951,"cta":{"id":2765,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Selling_Point_6afcdf4970.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_6afcdf4970","name":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Binghatti City: Where Automotive Excellence Shapes Iconic Urban Living","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Nad Al Sheba Location – Strategically positioned near major highways, ensuring seamless connectivity to Dubai’s key business and lifestyle hubs.</li><li>Iconic Mercedes-Benz Brand DNA – A residential environment inspired by Mercedes-Benz design, innovation, and timeless global prestige.</li><li>Fully Master-Planned Community – Binghatti’s first integrated city development, thoughtfully designed for balanced urban living and long-term value.</li><li>Elegantly-Designed Towers – Composed of 12 towers unified by a cohesive branded city concept.</li><li>Lifestyle-Focused Amenities – Curated leisure, wellness, retail, and green spaces designed to enhance everyday living experiences.</li><li>Renowned Developer Expertise – Developed by Binghatti, known for delivering distinctive, design-led residential landmarks across Dubai.</li><li>Successful Brand Collaboration – Second landmark partnership between Binghatti and Mercedes-Benz, building on proven international success</li><li>High Capital Appreciation Potential – A rare branded city concept positioned to benefit from long-term demand and value growth.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1952,"cta":{"id":2766,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_66194ab77b.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_66194ab77b","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"A Prime Meydan Location With Exceptional City Access","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Mercedes-Benz Places – Binghatti City at Meydan is located in Nad Al Sheba 1, offering direct access to key routes including Dubai – Al Ain Road (E66) and Ras Al Khor Road (E44). This strategic positioning ensures smooth connectivity to major commercial districts, cultural destinations, and Dubai’s most prominent lifestyle hubs while maintaining a refined, community-focused environment.</p><p>3 minutes – Meydan Hotel &amp; Racecourse</p><p>8 minutes – Dubai Mall</p><p>8 minutes – Burj Khalifa</p><p>9 minutes – Museum of the Future</p><p>10 minutes – Dubai World Trade Centre</p><p>15 minutes – Burj Al Arab</p>","design_title":